// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P389598239" "Oh, you're next.  And then you.  Oh, can't forget you.  My prey..."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2201402923" "Mark target Theta six-oh-one, bearing north by northwest."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4020214441" "Mark target Delta three-three-two, holding at position thirty-three mark seven."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2060044886" "Fascist scum, your day of reckoning will come...yeah, gonna burn you out of your holes..."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1274142748" "Look at them, bunch of clueless sheep, can't even see the cage they're in."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P34855627" "We've been marked! Take 'em down!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3020262841" "Advance Squad to base, we've been discovered. Moving to terminate witnesses."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P825485966" "Bad peepers seeing what they're not supposed to....they'll have to come out."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1016045849" "Take 'em down fast! We can't have them alerting the PPD!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3983375381" "Found us, eh? Too bad for you. Can't have the dog barking to its master."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_DUOSCOUT_CROUCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1913502218" "Destroy the loyalist scum!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1461674059" "The Sorceress believes our information drops have been compromised. This isn't the first time one of our operations have run right into a PPD ambush."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3498454742" "Belladonna still refuses to take the fight to Tyrant. If we had half their numbers, we'd have the Emperor's head on a pike by now."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3334147847" "When Marcus Cole betrayed Richter at the Well, he cast his fate before the Furies to be judged.<em>We are the instruments of that judgement and his crimes shall be writ upon the sky in the smoke of his ruined ambitions. So have the Furies commanded."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4169041059" "It is time for Marcus Cole to suffer and burn, to have his body and mind rent by the talons of righteous vengeance.<em>The victims cry out for justice, and we shall give it to them."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1427818318" "Gird yourselves for the struggle to come, my sisters, for vengeance is a bloody work, but just, and we shall not shrink from it.<em>Not an inch...not an iota."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4106526184" "We've been able to narrow down the possible locations where the PPD scum are keeping our sister. We must move quick before they transfer her to the Facility."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3592391317" "They deserve to die, all of them, for fostering this bloated lie, this so-called Emperor Cole.<em>They are all complicit in his tyranny through their blind obedience. Praetoria needs to burn."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2321942252" "Our scouts around Avatech have reported that the final components have arrived. Our strike teams are ready to move in at a moments notice."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3824857695" "We've been discovered! Stop them! Leave no survivors!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2220738423" "You! What have you heard? No matter, you won't be leaving here alive."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4247652874" "Witnesses! Destroy them!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P347006096" "PPD spies! We'll send your corpses back to your superiors!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_MEETING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P94278604" "Spies! Paint the walls red with their blood as a warning to the others!"

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2696691944" "No...he was not among the captives....Right, kill them all. As you command Sister."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2056726383" "Yes, they begged for mercy once we gained the upper hand.<em>Cowards.<em>Should we execute them now, or would you prefer we wait for your arrival?"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1268614401" "Please give me the order to kill them...their pathetic begging is starting to bore me."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1953562447" "What? You want us to bring them in? What could they possibly have to tell us?<em>They're of more value to us dead."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1828275862" "Yes, we have them in custody and were just about to execute them...was there anything else we needed to learn from them?"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_PPDCAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P958501951" "Yes, we were just about to splatter their worthless lives all over the concrete, but if you'd prefer we wait for you, we will.<em>I know how much you enjoy seeing the fear in their eyes."

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_BOSS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2954854309" "You! You! Take them out! Go! Go! Go!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_BOSS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4062200573" "End them, Sisters."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_BOSS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1230387157" "No! We can't let them interfere! Destroy them!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_BOSS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1328589162" "Your beloved Emperor cannot save you now, fool."

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_MISCHIEF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P515181333" "Yes sister, we are leaving the message as ordered, but I don't understand how this helps our cause."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_MISCHIEF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1237475368" "Spray painting graffiti is something Calvin Scott's people do. I don't see how this serves the cause of Vengeance."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_MISCHIEF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3869006624" "The sister wants to know how you spell ignominy.<em>Is it 'm-i-n-y' or 'm-o-n-y'?"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_MISCHIEF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3178287648" "Yes, we are leaving the message as you intended, Sister."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_MISCHIEF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P993935664" "Can I just say, Sister, that I think vandalism is beneath our mission.<em>Guerrilla art... we're warriors, not punk kids."

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2053432005" "'Ignominy'....how do you spell that?"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2173307620" "Must we do this? We write our messages in blood, not paint...<em>and the fumes are making me nauseous."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1133804504" "You know that Praetor Sinclair is just going to think Scott's people did this, so what's the point?"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P419546099" "Who's idea was this anyway? Graffiti?<em>Seems sorta weak for us to be doing this, if you ask me."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4003431452" "Once the people of Praetoria see this they'll know that the Talons of Vengeance were here."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3265857049" "I wish I could see Praetor Sinclair's face when he sees this."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3694034109" "Opening minds one tag at a time,"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890811789" "If my art professor saw me now, he'd be so happy.<em> Did I tell you the PPD took him away in one of their morning raids?"

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P230900731" "Crap, we've been spotted. I'm not done yet!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3988759535" "Dammit, almost finished too!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2740652663" "Hold them off while I finish up here."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P113376322" "Just...one...more...letter. There, okay, lets kick some ass!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_SPRAYPAINTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2506116120" "Dammit! I got some paint in my eye!"

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P935308427" "Dammit, we've been spotted and I haven't finished the scan yet!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1360799681" "Curse them, only three microcycles to go!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026540978" "Keep them away until the scan is complete."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P820317446" "Just...one...more...pass! There! Now lets teach them a lesson!"

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P967622184" "Hurt him some before you turn out the lights. He deserves no less."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P238102218" "Feeling powerless, scumbag?<em>Now you know what it's like for all of us.<em>Every day."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P811278082" "Have fun with him, my sisters. I want his masters to have nightmares after they see what's left."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1962467194" "Take no pity on him, my Sisters. A wounded snake is still a snake."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4027204313" "In your final moments, worm, consider the other paths your life might have taken and the choices you made that led you here.<em>Any regrets?"
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3060326316" "How low the mighty have fallen. Any last words before we render judgement upon you?"
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2345087034" "Time to get dirty, my Sisters.<em>Once you're done with him the PPD are going to need a DNA test to figure out who he was."

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P892245789" "Got some of your PPD buddies to come to your rescue, eh?<em>Too late for you though!"
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P867459926" "Put our friend out of his misery while I deal with this...distraction."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1952432714" "Come to join the fun? You can have any part of him you like, but the ears are mine."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_ASSAULTING_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2079900352" "Who have we here? More puppets of the State?<em>Good, I was getting bored with this one."

// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3897874567" "You are an instrument of Fate, bringing the Judgement of the Universe upon oathbreakers, despoilers, and false prophets.<em>Take up your Fang so that you may worry the necks of the wicked and spill their blood for vengeance sake."
// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P998582166" "The Emperor has consigned himself and all he has made to destruction at our hands.<em>So the Erinyes command. So you shall obey."
// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1999371804" "And when the time of Judgement is upon you, do not hesitate.<em>Be deaf to their pleas.<em>Be blind to their enticements.<em>Be cold to their sympathies.<em>You have no mercy, only righteous vengeance."
// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2334079387" "And when the scum beg for mercy, dig the knife in just a little deeper.<em>Every attempt to elicit your sympathy is just another display of their weakness.<em>Look them in the eyes when you cut the life from them.<em>Let them know, without any doubt, that to them you are not human.<em>You are death... their death... and there is no escape."
// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1672056068" "You are Tisiphone, avenging the murdered.<em>You are Magaera, the grudge that only grows with time.<em>You are Alecto, without forgiveness or mercy.<em>Rise, Talon of Vengeance, and drive your claw deep into the heart of the Tyrant."
// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2257206168" "Cast aside your humanity, for only without it can you truly embrace the spirit of vengeance.<em>Your humanity will cause you to hesitate when swift action is required.<em>Humanity can only bring you grief when the killing time has come.<em>Leave it behind you Sister, and take up your Talon."

// MAGISTERIUM_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1846290696" "No! We cannot let them interfere! Destroy them!"

// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P63637506" "Still no sign of the target."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P666213307" "Look at the sheep, going about their daily programming. If they only knew..."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3231450358" "Sometimes I wonder if there are any innocents in this city.<em>If it was me behind the scope, I'd probably start shooting and never stop."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P573731911" "Whoa, whoa, target spotted...no...wait...Negative, it isn't her."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P988807511" "Hey! Target at nine-o-clock, man in the red shirt.<em>No, wait, disengage, it isn't him."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P732377152" "Sometimes I'm still struck by how peaceful Praetoria looks on the surface.<em>Sad that its all a lie."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P259843070" "BANG! dead.<em>BANG! dead.<em>BANG!<em>BANG!<em>BANG!<em>"

// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3699103893" "Damn you! Who was watching our six?"
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1069479503" "Impossible! How did you sneak up on our position?"
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3511281780" "Been marked! Aborting operation! Moving to engage!"
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P931996548" "We've been spotted. Sloppy. Real sloppy."
// MAGISTERIUM_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2640605665" "Should have minded your own business.<em>Be the last mistake you ever make."

// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3292644920" "Rip them up my sisters! Hurt them, they deserve to suffer!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2692131686" "Scared, you PPD scum? You should be."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400096366" "Tear them to pieces, my Sisters!<em>I want the PPD to have nightmares after they see what's left!."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3299174813" "They're just puppets of the Emperor! They are not human, my Sisters!<em>They are beneath you, worthy of only a quick death!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3473359498" "Imperial lapdogs, we are the Talons of Vengeance and we are sent to render judgement upon you!"
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_FIGHTING_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2579870167" "Let the gutters run red with their blood, my Sisters!<em>Rip them!<em>Tear them!<em>Gut them like the pigs they are!"

// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3550763239" "You sick psychos!<em>Take 'em out quick! We won't get another chance!"
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4231131139" "Terminate these rebels.<em>Your Emperor commands it!"
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P956571964" "By Imperial edict your lives are forfeit."
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2391242645" "By the grace of His Eminence, the Emperor Marcus Cole I command you to lay down your arms and cease hostilities immediately!"
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P878805268" "You rebel pukes are going down! Going down hard!"
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1329676513" "Destroy them for the glory of the Emperor!"
// MAGISTERIUM_PPD_FIGHTING_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2035926411" "How dare you defy the Emperor? Your disloyalty is an affront!<em>Kill them!<em>Kill them all!"

// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1440154383" "That makes seventeen personnel transfers through the rift in the last hour, an increase of twenty-five percent from the previous period yesterday."
// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P216277397" "Mark seven, track right forty-five degrees. Forty-five degrees mark. Track target delta-six, seventeen meters south of your position. Awaiting o-t-f."
// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3562775510" "This is just insane, what are they planning? Think Tyrant is planning on fleeing to a neighboring dimension?<em>He won't be able to escape our judgement, no matter where he runs to.<em>Coward."
// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3061388764" "What do you think is on the other side of that portal? Another Praetoria maybe? A Praetoria without Tyrant?<em>Imagine that, Sister."
// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1498759174" "...put the slug just behind and below the ear and it's like turning out a light...<em>...through the temple and the hydrostatic pressure wave will blow gray matter right out the nostrils..."
// RIFTENCLOSURE_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P751826221" "With this rifle, I deliver upon the wicked a righteous judgement.<em>With this bullet I answer the cries of the aggrieved.<em>I am the instrument of Vengeance.<em>I am the rifle.<em>I am the bullet."


// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2659787391" "The subject has yet to enter our kill zone, Sister. We will continue operations until the situation changes. Advance team out."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3929488314" "No sign of the missing extraction team. We will expand our search from here and transmit our report in five minutes."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3053916922" "The target has left Site B with an ETA at our location inside ten minutes."
// MAGISTERIUM_TOV_OPERATIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3119793727" "No, no sign of them yet, over.<em>Do you have any intelligence on unit complement?<em>I see...we will remain at our location until further orders, over."
