// FIRSTWARD_DUST_TOV_BATTLE_INACTIVE :
"P2246441609" "Echelon is going to want to know about this."

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_DUST_BATTLE_INACTIVE :
"P4230213142" "Inflict as much pain as you can before you take his life. He deserves no less."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_DUST_BATTLE_INACTIVE :
"P2194146630" "Feeling powerless, fool?<em>Now you know what it's like for all of us.<em>Every day."

