"P924166799" "New targets! Fire! Fire! Fire!"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_TOV_BATTLE_ALERTED :
"P2921087590" "Enemy backup inbound!"

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_DUST_BATTLE_ALERTED :
"P2941994682" "More usurpers come to your aid, eh?<em>Too late for you though!"



// FIRSTWARD_TOV_SPIES_INACTIVE :
"P3828471800" "Sometimes I wonder if there are any innocents in this city.<em>If my will were to be followed, I would burn this city to the ground and everyone with it."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_SPIES_INACTIVE :
"P471728426" "I believe I have spotted our subject."

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_SPIES_ALERTED :
"P2915123777" "Curses! How did they get so close without us noticing?"
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_SPIES_ALERTED :
"P1508381272" "We've been spotted! Ceasing surveillance! Engaging the enemy!"

// DARKASTORIA_PLACEWARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2480369873" "This should keep the fiends at bay..."
// DARKASTORIA_PLACEWARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2672878830" "Is it strong enough? Hrm... we need some way to test it."
// DARKASTORIA_PLACEWARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2244790617" "We don't want the guilty escaping now, do we?"

// DARKASTORIA_STUDYWARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P874376322" "I cannot think through these distractions?"
// DARKASTORIA_STUDYWARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1032173661" "The lackies swarm to defend their vile holdfast!"
// DARKASTORIA_STUDYWARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3843374070" "We will kill you first and then rip this ward down!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P380704415" "You are an instrument of Fate, transformed to oversee the tribulation that will bring rebirth to the world!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P955528538" "There is no hope, only the lie! Become a force of vengeance against its perpetrators!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1511325087" "We savage the guilty under the shadow of this false apocalypse.  Rise now as one of our warriors!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P103681092" "When darkness conquers this vile world, the Furies will bring the unsullied light of justice once more!  Rise as one of their harbingers!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2670858917" "Agents of deceit and darkness! Slay them quickly!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4117100311" "The righteous shall rise to meet your wickedness!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P15406091" "Do not interfere!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_INDUCTION_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1982842455" "The ritual is almost complete! As the final act, slay the wicked so that their blood may anoint you in your true purpose!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P569843038" "I... I don't know what you're talking about!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3314032443" "Why are you doing this?!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P804684666" "Please, let me go!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2028570002" "Whatever it is you think I've done... I'm sorry! Please!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1359469159" "These things are crazy!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3427812054" "Screw this! Everyone here is insane!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1478782743" "This wont end well..."

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1367895798" "You have been tried and sentenced... Prepare yourself!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3231463396" "We have seen enough! We need no other proof of your wickedness!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2067889742" "Just by being here, you prove your guilt!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1942043919" "Death! Death to the guilty!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3494671883" "Do not stand in the way of our retribution!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3613935112" "More wickedness! Slay them all!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P686650593" "Your conspirators have arrived! Take them!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_JUDGMENT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3948551280" "There can be no rescue for the guilty!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1606651046" "Lost, little mouse...?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1898119474" "Well, well... If the early bird doesn't get the worm."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P28104759" "How the tables have turned."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P384074486" "I will enjoy breaking you."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2395851852" "I will enjoy spilling your blood this night."

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ANIM_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1922290011" "Why is it getting so dark...?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ANIM_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3622027764" "I cannot move... What is happening to me?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ANIM_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1145597396" "Why am I so cold?"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P533642365" "Struggling will only intensify your pain, spirit!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P880663121" "Accept your fate, spirit, and give in to our power."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4094363657" "Yes! Yes! Pure energy... I can feel it coursing through my veins!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3937642823" "Drink up, my sisters! No need to ration with spirits so abundant!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981715287" "The weaker it gets the more powerful I become!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIRE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2831337529" "Something's not right here... Why can't I move?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIRE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2838878644" "Why are you doing this? I only wanted to play."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIRE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4174133282" "It's getting cold... so cold..."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIRE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4049629687" "This isn't funny, you guys!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ICE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2906081984" "Come now, girls. Afraid to get any closer? You're SO warm...."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ICE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1917109363" "Help! Somebody! I am frozen!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_ICE_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P925137845" "I... I cannot move! What's going on here?? Who are you people??"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHTNING_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1847327777" "Alright, ladies, let's make this quick."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHTNING_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3384449188" "So this is what it feels like to help others..."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHTNING_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2484704851" "If you're about to do what I think you are, do me a favor and get on with it."

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1790873089" "What's going on? I only wanted to help."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2291955165" "Why's it getting so dark..?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P258975561" "Say, who turned off the lights?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1334428431" "I don't feel so good..."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2285194119" "I've got a bad feeling about this..."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LIGHT_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1133153790" "Dark... so dark."

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_CRYSTAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1013809955" "Too much pressure! I am going... to... shatter!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_CRYSTAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1901503910" "Why have I not foreseen this??"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_CRYSTAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1660815300" "Wait! If you let me go... I will lead you toward much greater spells."

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2605280371" "Too much PRESSURE!<em>I am going... to...<em>SHATTER!!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3897188189" "Why have I not foreseen this?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P456900237" "Once I break free of these chains I will strike you ALL down!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2713418150" "I won't break so easily!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3813096132" "Once I break free of your bonds I will strike you ALL down!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1134060690" "That's it! I am going to snap!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3472418156" "I'd love to just walk away from all of this."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3562884253" "Wait! I have many uses! I beg you, do not destroy me!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3385900597" "NO! I don't want to go back to being a walking stick."

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_TOME_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2206614711" "Words cannot describe this inexplicable pain!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_TOME_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3628004198" "I am speechless!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_TOME_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3890052041" "My word! What is going on? What are you doing to me?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_TOME_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1834024186" "You gals must be tired from killing. What say you to a nice story?"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_AMBUSH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P451514550" "Going somewhere, prey?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_AMBUSH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P803609926" "Where are you scurrying off to, little mouse?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_AMBUSH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2452036366" "Leaving so soon?"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P968664009" "Eyes peeled, sisters...<em>This realm is rich in spiritual energy, but equally as dangerous."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P71376088" "We have lost too many already.<em>It may be time we recruit the dead into our flock."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1548841121" "This realm is ours for the taking, sisters. Revel in it!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3478078178" "I saw some outsiders earlier. They would be wise to steer clear of our territory."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2656636394" "We are no longer alone in this land.<em>Others have found their way in as well, but how?"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3234502373" "Imputent WORM!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1530075961" "Die WORM!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1758249491" "Claws out, Talons!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P338798631" "Interlopers! Slay them!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3468787600" "I shall enjoy swimming in your blood this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3463726743" "PREY!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2084030338" "Your thread just ran out, foolish mortal!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3839994945" "Ah... another plaything has arrived!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3818900335" "So much energy... So little resistance!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3115285069" "Once we weaken them, we can harvest their energy for our own!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P225199509" "Simple-minded things!<em>You shall receive a meaningless death."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P298895958" "Trying so hard, yet failing so miserably at their own existence.<em>Sisters, dispose of these...things!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P500574759" "Take them out quickly, I want their power NOW!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3728273222" "Kill everything, sisters! We swim in the blood of others this night!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3727388508" "Tear them to ribbons! I want to taste of their blood!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2616106019" "Break circle, Talons! We have new mice with which to play!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1951911226" "YOU! You have broken our hold on this one!<em>You MUST be punished!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1209732885" "Your misstep this day will cost you your life, foolish mortal!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P126773292" "Prepare to be flayed, fool!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P40417111" "FOOL! You dare interrupt our circle of power?"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1006658108" "Aha! Freedom!<em>Now it is I who shall strike at YOU!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_STAFF_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2352267408" "Now I will strike you ALL down!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2309469301" "Vie, you wicked women! I shan't break so easily!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1433479604" "Try as you might, wicked ones! You shall tire soon enough!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3253779158" "I will break free of your chains, creatures!<em>And when I do, I will run you ALL through!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1055879999" "I cannot...hold out...much longer.<em>Have all gods have abandoned me this night?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1715954389" "No... NO!<em>I cannot, WILL NOT succumb to this sorcery!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P445140701" "Alas, I am free! Now ALL will fall at my blade!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2206113194" "Pray to your gods, wicked ones! Vengeance is now MINE!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P992333610" "The gods look favorably upon me this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1471503512" "I live to avenge this slight another day!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_VORPAL_HARVESTED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4208574050" "Retreat!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1788759207" "So much energy. So little resistance!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1262782023" "Ha! Silly implement...<em>Thinks it has a mind of its own."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3344167535" "I can feel this one's about to crack!<em>And when it does we will ALL drink of its essence!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P894124827" "This one is especially resilient."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2891472384" "It has to break eventually<em>Don't stop until it does!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4230074822" "I want ALL its power!<em>Don't stop until its in splinters!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3475290847" "Quickly, sisters! I want its power NOW!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_HARVESTING_ANIMUS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P145255160" "You have broken our hold on this one!<em>You MUST be punished!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2191009171" "Foolish DOGS! They will all BLEED for this!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2756790640" "The LAST things these dogs will see is their own entrails SPILLING OUT!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P234432488" "THIS is the last straw...<em>We must attack while our fury burns!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P388413308" "So it has come to this?<em>So be it!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3864358219" "Black Knights... Ha!<em>We shall make their OWN GODS pity their suffering this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3848178441" "If these DOGS wish to have the fury of the Talons unleashed upon them this night, So it SHALL BE!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3358053530" "We bathe in blood this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_PLOTTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2882533828" "Kill quickly, sisters!"

